"si":"culture","blurb":"the community-run Bigodi Swamp walk on the forest edge — 200+ birds, more primates and a model of community tourism. STATUS: HELD","when":"HELD","commission":"none (advisory hold)","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"primary","deepdive":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["none"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A crater-and-forest lodge honeymoon (held)","si_tag":"ultra","status":"held","tier":"comfort","price_band":"HELD - no book path","timing":"HELD","draw_rank":null,"hook":"Kyaninga Lodge above its crater lake, Ndali Lodge, Primate Lodge in the forest — the ultra way to do the chimps","si":"ultra","blurb":"Kyaninga Lodge above its crater lake, Ndali Lodge, Primate Lodge in the forest — the ultra way to do the chimps","when":"HELD","commission":"none (advisory hold)","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["ultra"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","deepdive":"destination","ultra":"primary"},"commission_lane":["none"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"Where can I trek chimps instead, right now?","a":"Rwanda - Nyungwe Forest. We route all chimp demand there. **FCDO travel advice for Uganda:** the FCDO names no advisory against travel to Uganda. *https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/uganda — page updated 2026-07-27.*","source":"travelweekly.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Will this clear - should I wait for Kibale?","a":"Possibly - this is a health-driven, dynamic advisory (an outbreak, not conflict), so it can be lifted when the outbreak is contained. For a firm 2026 chimp trek, book Nyungwe now.","source":"travelweekly.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What would Kibale offer when it reopens?","a":"The primate capital of the world - up to 1,500 chimps and 13 primate species, the $250 chimp trek (and the full-day ~$300 Habituation Experience), plus the Bigodi wetland birding walk. All held until the advisory lifts.","source":"gorillatrackers.com","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"Is Kibale a safari (big-game) destination?","a":"No - it is a rainforest of primates, not a savanna, so big-game safari is a documented miss; the draw is the chimp and primate trek (a Global Adventures product), exactly like Rwanda''s Nyungwe. For Big game, we route to Kenya, Tanzania or Akagera.","source":"gorillatrackers.com","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"What are the non-Ebola health requirements for Uganda?","a":"Yellow fever is mandatory for entry (all travelers >=1 yr, checked at Entebbe, vaccinate >=10 days before); malaria prophylaxis is essential (all regions); carry AMREF Flying Doctors + insurance.","source":"cdc.gov","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_description":"What it is, why it''s held, and where to trek chimps instead (Rwanda''s Nyungwe Forest).","slug":"kibale-forest-uganda","primary_keyword":"Kibale Forest chimpanzee trekking","long_tail":["Kibale chimpanzee permit cost 2026","chimpanzee habituation experience Uganda","Kibale primate capital","Bigodi wetland walk","is Uganda safe Ebola","Kibale vs Nyungwe"],"search_language":"en","local_keywords":["Kibale","chimpanzee","Bigodi","Magombe","Kanyanchu","red colobus"],"hreflang":["en"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-01","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-01","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/uganda","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:47Z","